    {
      "en": "label makidate1:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe I’ll give Makoto’s mother a call?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Under most pretenses, I probably wouldn’t make my first call to someone I barely know just before nightfall, but she tends to work late anyway so maybe she’s used to it?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Besides, Makoto is pretty much always at the shop anyway and this might give me a good opportunity to be alone with her.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I tap on Maki’s name in my phone and listen to it ring a few times, hoping she picks up.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Maki? This is your daughter’s teacher.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, hey!",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Normally, people introduce themselves by their name and not their job over the phone.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Normally, people know their name to begin with.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry about that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No need to apologize. I just don't know what to call you.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just Sensei is fine.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hmm...Okay, okay. But if you get to go by your job, I want to as well.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You want me to call you...porn salesman?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Beautiful porn salesman preferably, but sure.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll see if I can remember that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So what’s up? Why are you calling so late?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did something happen with Makoto?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothing in particular. I just wanted to see if you’d like to meet up for coffee or something.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Coffee?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. It’s that brown stuff tired people drink.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei, are you asking a married woman out on a date right now?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, I suppose I am.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah! Well at least you’re up front about it.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can probably slip away for a little while if you want to meet up at Koi Cafe.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, that works for me. I’ll start heading over now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Same here. I’ll see you soon.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well...She just seems full of energy.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I have to admit, I saw that call ending a little differently once she brought out the “married woman” line.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But I guess it’s not really my place to question her relationship.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’ll just head over to the cafe and wait for her to get there.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
