    {
      "en": "scene mollycafe1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollycafe1.webp",
      "alt": "mollycafe1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Welcome to Good Burger, home of the Good Burger. Can I take your order?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...What?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s a thing. Don’t ask questions.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure, Molly.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can I just get a black coffee? I’m meeting someone here in a few minutes.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollycafe18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollycafe18.webp",
      "alt": "mollycafe18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Meeting someone? Like...on a date thingy?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh, I guess so.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s just Makoto’s mom.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Makoto? Like, glasses Makoto? The Witch of the West Wind?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You gave her a nickname too?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollycafe1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollycafe1.webp",
      "alt": "mollycafe1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course! And I’ll do my best to not disrupt your date thingy!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": As a fellow degenerate, I know just how hard it can be finding love in this day and age. I’m cheering for you, Sir!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really? I kind of saw this going a little differently.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, no! Not at all! Go sit down in the corner! I’ll even bring over something special once she gets here.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s really considerate of you, Molly. Thanks.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate1.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I take a seat near the back wall and wait for Maki to arrive.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I wonder what sort of “special” thing Molly is going to bring over once the time comes?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I hope it’s not anything explosive.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate2.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey. Sorry it took me so long. Makoto had a question about blowjobs that I needed to answer.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s probably the strangest intro to a date I’ve ever had the pleasure of hearing.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate3.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Such is the life of the newly proclaimed “Beautiful Porn Salesman.”",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, right. I forgot that was your nickname now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t worry. So did I until five seconds ago.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate4.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Which is also right around the time that I became acutely aware that I’m still wearing my tracksuit.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate3.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t mind, do you?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not at all. If anything, I think it even accentuates your beauty.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate5.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, they do look pretty nice in this, don’t they?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Most people beat around the bush when they say that, though.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate6.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heh. Bush.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Is Makoto really related to this woman?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate2.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But anyway, thanks for calling me and blah blah blah. It’s not often I get out anymore, which I’m sure you’re able to tell by the get-up.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate7.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh how I have longed for the days to go out and enjoy my youth once again.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The life of a parent is truly a rough one.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can imagine. Makoto’s a good girl, though. At least she makes it easy on you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate3.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She does now. But she was miserable as a kid. It was always “I want this. I want that. Buy me an encyclopedia.”",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate7.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, really? What kind of five year old wants an encyclopedia for their birthday? Ask for a pony or something. Jeez.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow. She was like that back then, too?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate2.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh yeah. Big time. But hey, at least she’s consistent. Right?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And she’s smarter than both her father and me now, so I can’t help but be proud of her.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate3.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": High maintenance or not, she’ll always be my little girl.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate8.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Molly shows up at the table and places a normal cup of coffee in front of Maki.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "How is this, in any way, special?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate9.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s strange. I just felt the atmosphere in here change a little.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It feels...darker in some way.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, that’s...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Someone is giving me the death-stare, aren’t they?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. I think that might be my fault.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Clíodhna, beseech unto me a fraction of your beauty so that I may leave this harlot in the grimy waters of Glandore to drown.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/makifirstdate10.webp",
      "alt": "makifirstdate10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh, hello there.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly, please tell me that the coffee you brought to the table isn't poisoned.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you think you're doing here?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Umm...Have I done something to offend you?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": State your name and occupation, harlot.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maki Miyamura. Beautiful porn salesman.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And what exactly is it you intend to do with my master, Maki Miyamura?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Master?...",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene makifirstdate11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
